#ASSERT `What are my ordinary weekly hours under the maximum-hours rule` `as the employee` FALSE FALSE 0 EQUALS `hours` 38
#ASSERT `What are my ordinary weekly hours under the maximum-hours rule` `as the employee` FALSE TRUE 35 EQUALS `hours` 35
#ASSERT `What are my ordinary weekly hours under the maximum-hours rule` `as the employee` FALSE TRUE 40 EQUALS `hours` (`What are my ordinary weekly hours` TRUE 40)
